  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "荀子",
    "sub_ename": "XUNZI",
    "describe_ch": "荀子為先秦重要儒者，且其思想在一定程度上，也反映出戰國時期至秦漢大一統帝國之間的轉折。本課程為學期課程，故將選讀《荀子》中幾篇能夠突顯出其思想特色的篇章，如〈不苟〉、〈非十二子〉、〈天論〉、〈正論〉、〈禮論〉、〈解蔽〉、〈正名〉、〈性惡〉等。期能在教授過程中，讓學生掌握先秦儒學更為完整的學說、荀子的重要主張，以及學習文獻釋讀、概念分析和問題思辨等能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Xunzi was an important Confucian scholar in the pre-Qin period, and his thoughts, to a certain extent, reflected the transition from the Warring States period to the unified empire of the Qin and Han dynasties. This course is a semester course, so you will read several chapters in \"Xunzi\" that can highlight the characteristics of his thoughts, such as \"BuGou\", \"Not the Twelve Sons\", \"Lun of Heaven\", \"Lun of Zheng\", \"Lun of Rites\", \"Uncovering\", \"Rectification of Names\", \"Evil Nature\", etc. It is expected that during the teaching process, students will be able to master the more complete doctrines of Pre-Qin Confucianism and the important propositions of Xunzi, as well as learn the abilities of document interpretation, conceptual analysis, and problem thinking.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生能基本掌握荀子生平及其著作。",
      "describe_en": "Have a basic understanding of Xunzi’s life and works."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具體研讀《荀子》重要篇章。",
      "describe_en": "Study the important chapters of \"Xunzi\" in detail."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "讓學生能理解荀子在中國思想史上的位置及其學說意義。",
      "describe_en": "To understand Xunzi's position in the history of Chinese thought and the significance of his theory."
    }
  ],
